    ["<Highlight>Tingen</>, a city located in the northern part of the Loen Kingdom. Noisy mornings, hurried workers, and flowing street vendors constitute the background of its daily life. In this city, Klein met the reliable Captain Dunn, who had a poor memory, got to know the kind and stubborn teacher Old Neil, and found Mr. Azik, a mentor who spanned a long history."] = "<Highlight>Тинген</>, a city located in the northern part of the Loen Kingdom. Noisy mornings, hurried workers, and flowing street vendors constitute the background of its daily life. In this city, Klein met the reliable Captain Dunn, who had a poor memory, got to know the kind and stubborn teacher Old Neil, and found Mr. Azik, a mentor who spanned a long history.",
